        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-21T05:32:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>ROD is my favorite Environment by far, just because of how crazy things can get there.&nbsp; Though I wish it had fewer copies of Ethereal Bonds and Portal Fiend, as those aren't all that interesting compared to the Distortions.&nbsp; (Where is \"Agoraphobic Delusion\", dammit?)&nbsp; I love Exploding Bubbles though...it's fun to knock them down to 1 HP and then let them hit the villain every turn.&nbsp; And Time Flies is just so much fun, to say nothing of the craziness of Imbued Vitality.</p>",
